# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback for the demo platform.
#
# Real files served directly by Pages (no fallback needed):
#   /demo/index.html
#   /demo/s/<id>/index.html  (pre-rendered for every deck in apps/slides/slides/)
#
# After the inline router-base-reconcile <script> in demo/index.html runs,
# history.replaceState strips the /demo prefix → URL bar shows /s/<id>.
# If a visitor refreshes or shares that URL, /s/<id> has no underlying file,
# so fall back to /demo/index.html (URL stays /s/<id>) so the open-slide
# router can re-render.

/s/*            /demo/index.html        200
/demo/themes/*  /demo/index.html        200
